            {
               "text": "### O Grande Zimbábue\n\nNeste mapa, a África tem um pequeno ponto vermelho que marca a posição aproximada do Grande Zimbábue (<htcite0>; <htcite1>).",
               "source": [
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "10cd855b-c2dc-4045-8a6c-f8486ef67cfa",
                     "text": "Mapswire",
                     "page": "",
                     "date_time": {
                        "type": "gregory",
                        "year": "",
                        "month": "",
                        "day": ""
                     }
                  },
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "19934031-f0f5-4a1d-83c3-6391b5acaff8",
                     "text": "The National Museum and Monuments of Zimbabwe",
                     "page": "",
                     "date_time": {
                        "type": "gregory",
                        "year": "",
                        "month": "",
                        "day": ""
                     }
                  }
               ],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "#### O povo Shona\n\nA expansão bantu deu origem a cerca de 500 línguas diferentes (<htcite0>; <htcite1>). Um dos povos que falam línguas bantu é o Shona. Entre os muitos avanços conhecidos, eles construíram o que hoje chamamos de Grande Zimbábue (<htcite2>), mostrado na **Figura 2**.",
               "source": [
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "c5ab3b9d-0f70-4fa2-80b7-4fc381c47187",
                     "text": "Fortes-Lima, C.A., Burgarella, C., Hammarén, R. et al",
                     "page": "",
                     "date_time": {
                        "type": "gregory",
                        "year": "2024",
                        "month": "",
                        "day": ""
                     }
                  },
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "8c10d904-305e-4a71-9ccf-28e6c83f7280",
                     "text": "History Tracers Team",
                     "page": "O povo Bantu",
                     "date_time": {
                        "type": "gregory",
                        "year": "2025",
                        "month": "",
                        "day": ""
                     }
                  },
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "0c717575-d51a-464d-9be6-8ecfda771376",
                     "text": "History Tracers Team",
                     "page": "Grande Zimbábue",
                     "date_time": {
                        "type": "gregory",
                        "year": "2025",
                        "month": "",
                        "day": ""
                     }
                  }
               ],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p class=\"desc\"><img class=\"imgcenter\" id=\"imgWALL\" onclick=\"htImageZoom('imgWALL', '0%')\"/><b>Figura 2</b>: Monumento Nacional Grande Zimbábue (<htcite0>). Foto de Erik Eschweiler-Dienerowitz, disponível no site da UNESCO (<htcite1>). Compartilhada sob a licença <a href=\"https://whc.unesco.org/en/licenses/6\" target=\"_blank\">Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 IGO</a>.</p>",
               "source": [
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "19934031-f0f5-4a1d-83c3-6391b5acaff8",
                     "text": "The National Museum and Monuments of Zimbabwe",
                     "page": "",
                     "date_time": {
                        "type": "gregory",
                        "year": "2024",
                        "month": "02",
                        "day": "01"
                     }
                  },
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "b7d68d4b-67a9-4624-9ce6-9b0e2f01c50e",
                     "text": "UNESCO",
                     "page": "",
                     "date_time": {
                        "type": "gregory",
                        "year": "2025",
